   "x": 40,
   "y": 1320,
   "width": 1100,
   "height": 120,
   "text": "Not drawn, to keep the arrows readable:\n· every section and component imports utils/dom.js (createEl) and data/copy.js\n· current, hourly and forecast import utils/format.js · search imports utils/debounce.js\n· utils/format.js imports data/config.js (locale and unit symbols)\n· index.js imports styles/*.css and state/actions.js (loadLocation() on start)\n· api/process-weather.js imports data/themes.js, data/copy.js and utils/format.js",
